config BR2_PACKAGE_VCGENCMD
	bool "vcgencmd"
	help
	  Raspberry Pi VideoCore userspace tools, built from
	  github.com/raspberrypi/userland: vcgencmd (SoC temperature,
	  voltages, clocks, throttling status), plus vcmailbox, dtoverlay
	  and dtmerge. Buildroot dropped its own rpi-userland package
	  upstream (Config.in.legacy: "ancient and deprecated") -- this
	  vendors just the small subset actually useful here directly,
	  pinned to a single commit. Not named rpi-userland/RPI_USERLAND
	  to avoid colliding with that removed package's reserved legacy
	  Kconfig symbol.

	  Deliberately not the GL/EGL/OpenMAX/MMAL/raspicam side of this
	  tree -- upstream's own CMakeLists already skips all of that on
	  aarch64 (ARM64 build), which is all this image ever targets, so
	  there's nothing to trim by hand here.

	  https://github.com/raspberrypi/userland
